id: way-of-the-mystic
name: Way of the Mystic
order: 5
optionOf: quick-to-master
optionEffect: 3
description: >
  Reduce the TP Cost of all Unique Abilities by 5 TP.
text: >
  Way of the Mystic [Passive]: Reduce the TP Cost of all Unique Abilities by 5 TP.

---

# Technical and Magical alike - never below half the listed cost (unique.mjs uniqueTPOf).
[passive]
unique.technical.tpCost -= 5;
unique.magical.tpCost -= 5;
